  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Match Column-I with Column-II :</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><strong>Column-I (x-t graphs)</strong></td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><strong>Column-II (v-t graphs)</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>A</td>\t\t\t<td><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/a93a3577-e9a7-4822-ac03-ed49a273718c-9895369_1.PNG\" style=\"width: 120px; height: 142px;\" /></td>\t\t\t<td>I</td>\t\t\t<td><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/9823f8a8-ea83-4cbb-a6a8-dc0c24d00d03-9895369_5.PNG\" style=\"width: 112px; height: 143px;\" /></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>B</td>\t\t\t<td><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/cbabd51f-2221-4567-95cc-e956a042b78a-6db6f371-02ff-4ed5-81d2-2c1ee0ee95d0-9895369_2.PNG\" style=\"width: 125px; height: 137px;\" /></td>\t\t\t<td>II</td>\t\t\t<td><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/c234cd67-2a0e-499d-ace8-a01abf2d0f38-9895369_6.PNG\" style=\"width: 127px; height: 149px;\" /></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>C</td>\t\t\t<td><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/a1245e56-3f30-411b-b778-83b713901ed8-9895369_3.PNG\" style=\"width: 130px; height: 165px;\" /></td>\t\t\t<td>III</td>\t\t\t<td><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/f6c6c70f-6c61-433d-aed9-fdf42b9e5cec-9895369_7.PNG\" style=\"width: 146px; height: 200px;\" /></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>D</td>\t\t\t<td><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/2bf6fb79-1819-4db7-b3f7-71bb9af1298c-9895369_4.PNG\" style=\"width: 125px; height: 154px;\" /></td>\t\t\t<td>IV</td>\t\t\t<td><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/83ac15f1-1639-4008-80af-3aa79c1a99bd-9895369_8.PNG\" style=\"width: 143px; height: 134px;\" /></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>",
    "image": null
